      "content": "I'll read the original test and CUT source to understand what needs to be improved.Now I'll write the improved test with better understandability — extracting the encoder to a local variable and adding a brief explanatory comment about why both names produce the same Soundex code.The improved test compiled successfully. The changes made were: extracting the encoder to a local variable `soundex`, introducing an `expectedCode` variable to make the shared assertion value explicit, and adding a Javadoc comment explaining why \"Smith\" and \"Smythe\" produce the same Soundex code \"S530\"."
